	(text "R1803 and R1802 (10.0 kOhm each) divide DDR1V35 into REFIN_VTT. V(VTT) and\nV(DDR_VREF) approximately equal V(DDR1V35) / 2 = 0.675 V at 1.35 V. C1802\n(100 nF) filters REFIN. Preserve the 1:1 ratio when changing the memory I/O\nvoltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
