	(text "This block supplies the termination bias and receiver reference for MIRA's\n1.35 V DDR interface. VTT sources and sinks termination current; DDR_VREF\nsets the receiver threshold. Both track half of DDR1V35 so the interface\nfollows its memory I/O supply."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9072f585-106a-474b-a91d-65be1463dde6")
	)
	(text "CMD_VTT drives Q1801.\nR1801 pulls EN_VTT low.\nDDR_VREF remains on with EN low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 73 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a20e4a20-effc-47a8-999d-b8a69bcf5ecc")
	)
	(text "U1801 (TPS51200) uses AON for VIN and DDR1V35 for VLDOIN. Q1801 controls\nEN_VTT from CMD_VTT; R1801 (100 kOhm) pulls EN low when Q1801 is off.\nDisabling EN discharges VTT; DDR_VREF remains active while its input supplies\nare valid."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 65.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a3d8f0d5-7501-40f1-84ae-39eb2084aa05")
	)
	(text "1800_DDR_VTT_REFERENCE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a919c665-8ecf-41d5-9511-824fb9f2f0f8")
	)
	(text "DDR termination and reference, half of DDR1V35"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 26.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.35 2.35)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c22b4a56-1947-4eb4-9570-a53dfe732547")
	)
	(text "U1801 is a linear source/sink regulator. C1801 (10 uF) and C1803 (4.7 uF)\nbypass its two inputs. C1805-C1807 provide 30 uF nominal on VTT; C1804 (100\nnF) bypasses DDR_VREF. VOSNS senses the VTT net; route it separately from the\nload-current path."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 90.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c8b27263-9915-431c-8ef9-42402600b903")
	)
	(text "Purpose and role"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ef12ec33-084d-4e09-9d0e-d25907649c4b")
	)
	(text "Conversion and filtering"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 85.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.9 1.9)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fc9f5231-30c3-4999-aa1c-8fcb220fb024")
	)
	(text "PGR_VTT is open drain and is pulled to AON by R1804 (10 kOhm). U1801 includes\nsoft start, source/sink current limiting, UVLO and thermal shutdown. These\nlimits are internal; the divider does not set a current trip. Available\ntermination current depends on thermal design and load."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 141 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ff6779fd-2994-4286-b70c-581595e146e4")
	)
